00:00:14.270 --> 00:00:15.103
- Love it.

00:00:15.103 --> 00:00:15.936
- And I was like, "did I write that?"

00:00:15.936 --> 00:00:16.890
- Did I write this?

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:18.550
- No but in this photo bomb picture

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:20.470
we did with Michelle
Obama, it's pretty great.

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:21.330
- Yes.

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:24.157
- But--
- Oh my (laughing)

