00:00:27.224 --> 00:00:29.570
like find the two
classiest people in there.

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:30.403
- [Meghan] Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:00:30.403 --> 00:00:31.236
- [Kelly] That'd be us in the back.

00:00:31.236 --> 00:00:32.680
- [Meghan] The blondes, that's us, yeah.

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:34.470
- Everybody else was meant to be there,

00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:35.900
and we were like, "what
ever we're crashing."

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:36.990
- I yelled at you, I was like "get in!"

00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:38.950
- Well it's Michelle Obama.

00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:39.816
- [Meghan] It's our last chance.

00:00:39.816 --> 00:00:40.649
- She's so lovely too.

00:00:40.649 --> 00:00:42.000
- She's was about to
leave, so that was it.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:42.960
- [Kelly] I know.
- You're welcome.

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:44.410
- Thank you. (laughing)

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:46.080
