for pictures, are you?

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:47.420
- Oh I just jump on it.

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:48.253
- Oh my god.

00:00:48.253 --> 00:00:49.980
- We didn't ask, we just
were in the right place,

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:50.813
