00:00:56.030 --> 00:00:56.863
They're here today?

00:00:56.863 --> 00:00:59.501
- Yes, they are in the front
row, ladies and gentlemen.

00:00:59.501 --> 00:01:00.800
(crowd cheering)

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:02.594
I love 'em!

00:01:02.594 --> 00:01:05.200
- My family comes to
work with me too, a lot.

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:07.050
Like my whole sometimes.

00:01:07.050 --> 00:01:08.420
My husband loves it.

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:09.516
- [Meghan] Awww.
- [Kelly] That's sarcasm.

00:01:09.516 --> 00:01:12.680
Yeah he's always like, "cool,
everyone's coming for a week."

00:01:12.680 --> 00:01:14.060
- [Meghan] Everyone's here.
- Cool, yeah.

00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:15.774
I love it though, I love to be surrounded,

00:01:15.774 --> 00:01:17.049
I have a cool family

00:01:17.049 --> 00:01:18.220
- Me too, usually they're like
in the green room chillin',

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:19.968
but you were the only one
that let them come out,

00:01:19.968 --> 00:01:21.470
and be in the front row!

00:01:21.470 --> 00:01:22.660
- I wanted them to come
out, I wanted them to come--

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:24.500
- It's their big day.
- I'm a fan of your dad,

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:25.840
I wish I had a dad like him,

00:01:25.840 --> 00:01:27.150
he's so cool.
- Awww.

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:28.590
- Like I had a not good situation--

00:01:28.590 --> 00:01:30.320
- [Meghan] I got a cool
dad, I got real lucky.

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:32.960
- You did, I want you to know
to be so grateful for that.

00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:34.060
- [Meghan] Oh yes.
- It's such a beautiful thing.

00:01:34.060 --> 00:01:35.718
- I am well aware, I cry all the time.

00:01:35.718 --> 00:01:36.758
(crowd cheering)

00:01:36.758 --> 00:01:39.710
- Anyway, I heard he took
over your social media.

00:01:39.710 --> 00:01:41.010
He's really supportive on that.

00:01:41.010 --> 00:01:45.510
- He's just really good at it,
and he's really brave at it.

00:01:45.510 --> 00:01:48.100
Like he post all the time to support me.

00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:50.850
One time he posted my outfit,
right before a big show,

00:01:50.850 --> 00:01:52.380
and it was supposed to be a big reveal,

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:54.219
but he posted it with
safety pins and all--

00:01:54.219 --> 00:01:55.325
- 'cause he's excited.
- And we were like,

00:01:55.325 --> 00:01:56.847
"What are you doin'?"

00:01:56.847 --> 00:01:58.968
And he's like, "I'm excited for the show,"

00:01:58.968 --> 00:02:00.730
and I was like, "oh, okay."

00:02:00.730 --> 00:02:02.290
- [Kelly] I love that!
- It was cute.

00:02:02.290 --> 00:02:04.024
- I love you Gary.
- [Meghan] I love you too.

00:02:04.024 --> 00:02:05.358
- Oh thank you, thank you so much.

00:02:05.358 --> 00:02:07.170
- I do, I love you too.

00:02:07.170 --> 00:02:08.243
- Wow, look it!

00:02:08.243 --> 00:02:10.600
(kelly laughing)

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:11.690
- [Meghan] He's a superstar.

00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:12.523
- [Kelly] Oh my god, I love you.

00:02:12.523 --> 00:02:14.350
So now you perform with Meghan, right?

00:02:14.350 --> 00:02:16.424
I've heard she's not the
only one gracing the stage.

00:02:16.424 --> 00:02:17.970
